<|start|>assistant to=user<|message|># 詞: 睇怕

1. 呢個星期落雨咁多，睇怕今晚嘅足球賽要取消。 (It's raining so much this week, I'm afraid the football match tonight will be cancelled.)
2. 佢成日夜晚瞓得好遲，睇怕身體會頂唔順。 (He stays up late every night, I'm afraid his body won't be able to take it.)
3. 佢而家咁瘦，睇怕係病咗。 (He's so thin now, I'm afraid he's sick.)
4. 佢哋遲咗咁耐都未到，睇怕係迷路喇。 (They're so late and still haven't arrived, I'm afraid they're lost.)
5. 呢個價錢咁平，睇怕有啲嘢唔對路。 (The price is so cheap, I'm afraid something is not right.)
6. 佢話要請假一個月，睇怕係要移民。 (He said he needs to take a month off, I'm afraid he's going to emigrate.)
7. 佢個樣咁攰，睇怕冇瞓好。 (He looks so tired, I'm afraid he didn't sleep well.)
8. 佢哋成日爭吵，睇怕遲早會分手。 (They argue all the time, I'm afraid they'll break up sooner or later.)
9. 佢食咗咁多藥，睇怕會對肝有影響。 (He's taken so much medicine, I'm afraid it will affect his liver.)
10. 天氣報告話有颱風，睇怕要放颱風假。 (The weather forecast says there's a typhoon, I'm afraid we'll have a typhoon holiday.) [end of text]


